I open the last box.
It is a box with things from Mexico.
Right at the bottom of the box, there is a photo.
It is a photo of my family.
My mother, my father, my sister, and my brother.
They are standing in the sun and smiling.
I smile too.
It is a good photo.
I take the photo out of the box.
I place it on the table in the living room.
I can see it from the sofa.
"Now you are here too," I say very softly.
Now my family is here in Copenhagen with me.
It is a warm and nice feeling.
